{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/89b1f8f62f3c349ff324c8a7e76672b3.avif?t=1759384941\" data-has-big width=1560 height=523 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/c90559505b76cce07e8ce8f9ef07c749.poster.avif?t=1759384941\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/c90559505b76cce07e8ce8f9ef07c749.webm?t=1759384941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/c90559505b76cce07e8ce8f9ef07c749.mp4?t=1759384941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/c9c779fd9007c857adbe68f773375ad4.avif?t=1759384941\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries into the future, mankind has learned to live with and survive the scourge of devices built by generations before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain electronics are now eternally afflicted by Neural Demonic Phenomenae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phones burn bright hundreds of years after their last charge, computers bleed and the evil foe whispers into your mind with any electronic tool available to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/35833153ea51713d295a473324b18222.avif?t=1759384941\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person view mode and inspection mode allow you to get up close and personal with the items that tell the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed pace that favors those who take their time to closely inspect the finer details of their surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A setting that is eerily like an American rural mid-western church community, but somehow not at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of inspectable, collectable and even reactive objects that can alter your surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/923405872386d8390ce40353f5b98d52.poster.avif?t=1759384941\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/923405872386d8390ce40353f5b98d52.webm?t=1759384941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/923405872386d8390ce40353f5b98d52.mp4?t=1759384941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611900?t=1759384941","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611900?t=1759384941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/5e48c447ec4a06e2ed1378421d06d88b6cce54b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759384941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/5e48c447ec4a06e2ed1378421d06d88b6cce54b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759384941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3750740,"description":